  msgStalled: Not getting further? Tap Start over, or type the product in instead.
  msgPauseReset: The scan was paused for a while, so it was put back to the start.
  msgDifferentProduct: 'That is a different product: a new scan was started for it.'
  msgSameAgain: Scanning the same product again. Its name is kept.
  msgStartedOver: Ready for a new product.
  msgReaderLoading: Getting the text reader ready...
  msgReaderMissing: The text reader is not available on this device. Type the product
